          <p class="mt-4 mb-3 mx-auto md:mx-0 max-w-[760px] text-[#DCE6F0] text-[1.08rem]">Te damos el espacio en servidor que necesitas para publicar tu <strong>página web</strong> y tener tus <strong>correos electrónicos corporativos</strong> (como contacto@tuempresa.cl), respaldado con infraestructura en el Cono Sur para máxima velocidad.</p>
          <p class="mb-8 inline-flex items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-2 text-[.95rem] font-semibold text-[#CFE9F2]"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-5 h-5 stroke-cyt shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="20" r="1.4"/><circle cx="18" cy="20" r="1.4"/><path d="M2.5 3.5h2.6l2.3 11.2a1.7 1.7 0 001.7 1.4h8.4a1.7 1.7 0 001.7-1.3l1.4-6.3H6"/></svg>Pagas en línea y empiezas hoy.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center md:justify-start gap-3">
            <a href="#hosting-global" class="inline-flex bg-yel hover:bg-yelhov text-ink font-display font-bold text-[.98rem] px-10 py-3.5 rounded-md shadow-[0_6px_20px_rgba(255,230,0,.28)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">Ver planes de hosting</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center md:justify-end">
          <img src={`${base}/server-rack.png`} alt="Rack de servidores en el data center de Fractal Host" width="285" height="464" class="w-full max-w-[300px] h-auto drop-shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,.45)] select-none" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <button id="slidePrev" aria-label="Lámina anterior" class="absolute left-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-white/30 bg-black/20 backdrop-blur-sm hover:border-cy hover:text-cyt flex items-center justify-center transition-colors cursor-pointer"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.4" class="w-4 h-4 stroke-current" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 6l-6 6 6 6"/></svg></button>
    <button id="slideNext" aria-label="Lámina siguiente" class="absolute right-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-white/30 bg-black/20 backdrop-blur-sm hover:border-cy hover:text-cyt flex items-center justify-center transition-colors cursor-pointer"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.4" class="w-4 h-4 stroke-current" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button>
    <div id="heroProgress" class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-[3px] bg-white/20 overflow-hidden"><span id="heroProgressFill" class="block h-full bg-cy transition-all duration-500" style="width:25%"></span></div>
  </div>
